/P 171 0 R
/T (The field of computational lit-crit has gone through three waves of development: statistical stylistic analysis, rule-based NLP information extraction, and today's LLM- based semantics comprehension. In the section below, we briefly review the most closely related studies from each wave and explore the place of Lit Mind in the research community.)
/E (The field of computational lit-crit has gone through three waves of development: statistical stylistic analysis, rule-based NLP information extraction, and today's LLM- based semantics comprehension. In the section below, we briefly review the most closely related studies from each wave and explore the place of Lit Mind in the research community.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
