/Title (One failure, if you will, in the relationship type classification. For many pairs, the offline keyword-based classifier will label the pair as "UNKNOWN" because the keyword doesn't always appear in the same small window as the character names. The Gemini-based classifier does much better because it takes the context of the entire passage into account. This is the best scenario for using the API-based mode for relationship analysis.)
